    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi ggplot users,<div><br></div><div>I want to put an equation inside of the plot, but don&#39;t know how to make an upper case.</div><div>How to make the R2 have upper case 2? Thanks.</div><div><br></div><div>figure1 = ggplot()+</div><div>    geom_point(data=DF, aes(x=day, y=temp))+</div><div>    annotate(&#39;text&#39;, x=5, y=2, label=&#39;y= ax + b, R2=0.95&#39;)</div><div>print(figure1)</div></div>\r\n"
    ]
   ]
  },
